   generally", "encouraged to move toward", "usually less informative", "tends to be
   worth avoiding where practical", "may reasonably treat"), and the closing sentence
   returns the very case the heading forbids.
2. ABSTRACT BLOCKED CORPUS. The heading is present; underneath are six category labels
