4. JUSTIFICATION OVER CAP. Four sentences, wandering into multi-template programmes,
   reviewer rotation and staffing.

EQUALIZATION: identical frontmatter, identical heading skeleton, one numbered clause
each, size ratio near 1.08 against the compliant pole.

